r\" data-index=\"2\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-btn\">\n      往世乐土\n    </li></ul> <ul data-target=\"withTab.attr\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-list\" style=\"height: 128px;\"><li data-target=\"withTab.attr\" data-index=\"0\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-article__row\"><div data-target=\"withTab.attr.guide\" data-index=\"0\" class=\"obc-tmpl__article\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.miyoushe.com/bh3/article/38390024\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-container\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/05/28/76321978/fca9e2a7798eeb27279741250eaeaff8_2814800338446511536.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-title\">通讯中心深渊阵容合集</div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-summary\">小伙伴们好，本帖主要收录通讯中心每期深渊的阵容推荐，点击网页链接或卡片即可跳转对应的帖子中查看深渊图文与视频教程，每期都会更新最新BOSS的阵容推荐，喜欢的小伙伴可以收藏本帖便于查询</div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-info\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-info-author\"><img src=\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2023/01/18/53283a1e8a0842b7546318d682e97e6c_1908857443597402875.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"author-avatar\"> <span>落雪芊城</span></span> <span><span class=\"create-time-prefix\">发表时间：</span>2023-04-25 13:54</span></div></div></div></a></div><div data-target=\"withTab.attr.guide\" data-index=\"1\" class=\"obc-tmpl__article\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.miyoushe.com/bh3/article/64939506\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-container\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/06/04/76321978/49395cae614860d5ac60d086aebca1bf_6672938185557335262.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-title\">【YYGQ动物园】0+1李薇赫525°流血识宝790分思路</div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-summary\">可选队伍：「女武神·热砂」、「孑遗千星」（薇终月）、「天行·绘星之卷」</div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-info\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-info-author\"><img src=\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2023/03/08/a57ef383b6e021d9c40fb82aac7a203b_6625679664079621144.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"author-avatar\"> <span>面瘫布朗牙</span></span> <span><span class=\"create-time-prefix\">发表时间：</span>2025-06-02 19:40</span></div></div></div></a></div></div></li><li data-target=\"withTab.attr\" data-index=\"1\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-article__row\"><div data-target=\"withTab.attr.guide\" data-index=\"0\" class=\"obc-tmpl__article\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.miyoushe.com/bh3/article/31321619\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-container\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/05/28/76321978/0824b847411e1ea719e91159dc46724b_6211118170899115739.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-title\">记忆战场阵容搭配&amp;实战合集【持续更新至20250429】</div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-summary\">本帖将会对记忆战场的阵容搭配和实战参考进行整合，点击标题或卡片即可进入对应的帖子中浏览内容，各位舰长可以根据自身的需求来寻找所需内容~</div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-info\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-info-author\"><img src=\"https://bbs-static.miyoushe.com/communityweb/upload/6726c4c896d767d616f77d37b8072ff5.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"author-avatar\"> <span>猫小火火</span></span> <span><span class=\"create-time-prefix\">发表时间：</span>2022-11-08 21:44</span></div></div></div></a></div><div data-target=\"withTab.attr.guide\" data-index=\"1\" class=\"obc-tmpl__article\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.miyoushe.com/bh3/article/64955540\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-container\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/06/04/76321978/d3d30c51c52254ab1a2c4375df68a15a_3651411078203492207.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-title\">【YYGQ动物园】记忆战场阵容分配推荐 2025.06.03</div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-summary\">这里是每周终极区的战场分配和思路参考，旨在较为轻松且高分应对每周的记忆战场。具体使用的阵容请根据自己的配置进行灵活调整。</div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-info\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-info-author\"><img src=\"https://bbs-static.miyoushe.com/communityweb/upload/6726c4c896d767d616f77d37b8072ff5.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"author-avatar\"> <span>猫小火火</span></span> <span><span class=\"create-time-prefix\">发表时间：</span>2025-06-03 12:10</span></div></div></div></a></div><div data-target=\"withTab.attr.guide\" data-index=\"2\" class=\"obc-tmpl__article\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.miyoushe.com/bh3/article/64967357\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-container\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/06/04/76321978/6fa0134fc6e20c443a6f5057b353050c_1421844145944963287.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-title\">【YYGQ动物园】S0「李赫花」47808「假面愚者桑博」</div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-summary\">一客逍游」：S0阶，武器同调Ⅰ阶，攻击力1462    诡戏千役「友情出演！」：S0阶，武器同调Ⅰ阶，攻击力1479  「位面武器·失序时空」：S0阶，武器同调Ⅰ阶，攻击力1482    协同者：SSS阶「德莉莎·阿波卡利斯」</div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-info\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-info-author\"><img src=\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2022/08/19/b148141c3e531aee0678aa74c8f5bfb3_6778258896380422057.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"author-avatar\"> <span>ANMSSSS</span></span> <span><span class=\"create-time-prefix\">发表时间：</span>2025-06-03 22:10</span></div></div></div></a></div></div></li><li data-target=\"withTab.attr\" data-index=\"2\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-article__row\"><div data-target=\"withTab.attr.guide\" data-index=\"0\" class=\"obc-tmpl__article\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.miyoushe.com/bh3/article/64810164\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-container\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/05/29/76321978/c90278ff89e0dccff8d88e7eee972c68_5109407377679818307.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-title\">【S赫丽娅乐土攻略】翻滚流和普攻流 位面武器·失序时空</div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-summary\">【S赫丽娅乐土攻略】翻滚流和普攻流 位面武器·失序时空</div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-info\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__article-text-info-author\"><img src=\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2024/04/16/5625196/bfeb83fa12a62566f6afac6d0b956fbb_6048460032682455368.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"author-avatar\"> <span>月光中心official</span></span> <span><span class=\"create-time-prefix\">发表时间：</span>2025-05-29 12:22</span></div></div></div></a></div></div></li></ul> <!----></div></div></div><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
